-> Russell of Edelstein, Illinois. *Sealed Secrets* follows a dreamy,
-> freckle-faced farm girl, Alice Parepa-Roza Wesley, from her father's
-> farm to her aunt and uncle's home in Peoria. *Kashema* returns to her
-> years later.
